  "end-hollow": "@title The Demo — Ending\n@bg hall\n@mood hope\n\nnarrate This is the demo ending \"hollow\".\nnarrate In a real game this is where the story lands, shaped by the four axes.\nnarrate Write your own in scenes/endings/end-hollow.scene.\n\n@ending hollow\n",
